COMPILATION OF: E48D8

D: Disk Print
L: List Source Program

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 1

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 2

PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: E48D8

   1 a 0000 E48D8:
   2 a 0006   procedure options(main);
   3 a 0006   /* [E2E-48/P2d] the biased integer compare materialiser with |c|
   4 a 0006      in 2 and 3 in a STORE -- [C310] pins only c = 0 and |c| >= 4
   5 a 0006      there, while the TEST route [C143] switches to `DCX H x c' at
   6 a 0006      |c| <= 3 (E48A13 = 3 vs E48A12 = 4). Two targets, so each site
   7 a 0006      is addressable. */
   8 c 0006   dcl b bit(1) static initial('0'b);
   9 c 0006   dcl c bit(1) static initial('0'b),
  10 c 0006       k fixed bin(15);
  11 c 0006   b = (k = 2);
  12 c 0013   c = (k = 3);
  13 c 0021   put list('B=', b, 'C=', c);
  14 c 0059   stop;
  15 a 005C end E48D8;

CODE SIZE = 005C
DATA AREA = 0008
FREE SYMS = 3880
END  COMPILATION
